    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677010/extras/657348392ea9405a77ebbf39fc1a3220.poster.avif?t=1744592688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677010/extras/657348392ea9405a77ebbf39fc1a3220.webm?t=1744592688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf24 WOOD &amp; WEATHER</strong> </h2><strong><i>Wood &amp; Weather</i></strong> is a single player god-game created as a sandbox for <strong>introducing unplanned weather on a wooden toy city</strong> and dealing with the dramatic changes it causes over time.<br><br>\ud83d\udc4b <strong>Play as an ethereal blue hand</strong> and with the aid of a \u2728<strong>friendly wizard</strong> \u2728, you have the ability to <strong>fly, walk,</strong> and <strong>manipulate the little open-world</strong> through <strong>unexpected physics-driven, toybox interactions</strong><br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>The small wooden people</strong> who make up the vibrant city are trying to make their place in the world. How much of a permanent effect will you have in their lives? Only time (and weather) will tell. \ud83c\udf08<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc49  Take control of an ethereal god-like hand.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf26  Change the weather and see the various effects it has on the city and its people.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udca1  Impress and inspire the citizen to help fulfil their life aspirations.<br></li><li>\ud83e\udeb5  Interact with a clunky wooden toy city.<br></li><li>\u2614\ufe0f  Get to know the range of personalities who make up this tiny world.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf43  Exist in a lively dynamic open world that you can manipulate.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb7  Music by Dan Golding. (<i>Untitled Goose Game, Frog Detective</i>)<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfe1  Not exactly a city builder.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677010/extras/d86d4905f968f3839fccec8dec999247.avif?t=1744592688\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf24 WOOD &amp; WEATHER</strong> </h2><strong><i>Wood &amp; Weather</i></strong> is a single player god-game created as a sandbox for <strong>introducing unplanned weather on a wooden toy city</strong> and dealing with the dramatic changes it causes over time.<br><br>\ud83d\udc4b <strong>Play as an ethereal blue hand</strong> and with the aid of a \u2728<strong>friendly wizard</strong> \u2728, you have the ability to <strong>fly, walk,</strong> and <strong>manipulate the little open-world</strong> through <strong>unexpected physics-driven, toybox interactions</strong><br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>The small wooden people</strong> who make up the vibrant city are trying to make their place in the world. How much of a permanent effect will you have in their lives? Only time (and weather) will tell. \ud83c\udf08<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc49  Take control of an ethereal god-like hand.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf26  Change the weather and see the various effects it has on the city and its people.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udca1  Impress and inspire the citizen to help fulfil their life aspirations.<br></li><li>\ud83e\udeb5  Interact with a clunky wooden toy city.<br></li><li>\u2614\ufe0f  Get to know the range of personalities who make up this tiny world.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf43  Exist in a lively dynamic open world that you can manipulate.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb7  Music by Dan Golding. (<i>Untitled Goose Game, Frog Detective</i>)<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfe1  Not exactly a city builder.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677010/extras/d86d4905f968f3839fccec8dec999247.avif?t=1744592688\" /></div>",
